## =====================================================================
## ELKH Project-Specific .gitignore
## =====================================================================
## Common patterns (build artifacts, IDE files, OS noise, secrets, etc.)
## are covered by the root .gitignore at the repository level.
## Add ONLY patterns that are specific to the ELKH project here.
## =====================================================================

# =====================================================================
# Development Database (EF Core local SQLite)
# =====================================================================
# These are already tracked at root level (/ELKH/app.db etc.)
# but listed here for clarity if the path ever changes.
app.db
app.db-shm
app.db-wal

# =====================================================================
# ASP.NET Core Data Protection Keys
# =====================================================================
# Auto-generated key ring — must never be committed
DataProtection-Keys/

# =====================================================================
# User Secrets (ASP.NET Core)
# =====================================================================
# Handled by secrets.json outside the project, but ignore any
# accidental local copies.
secrets.json
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Production.json
appsettings.Staging.json